@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Zen Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangle { BackgroundColor #F7F7F5
BorderColor #444444
RoundCorner 12 }
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C9B458
skinparam padding 6
rectangle "道\n模型名 × 卖场或接口" as Lane
rectangle "案\n一道计分题" as Case
rectangle "卷\n一次作答记录" as Run
rectangle "结果\n过 · 没过 · NA" as Result
Lane -down-> Run : 作答
Case -down-> Run : 考的是
Run -down-> Result : 判分
note bottom of Result
NA = 作废或暂停：不算过，也不算没过。
end note
@enduml
